WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.716
My family has a new baby.

2
00:00:09.717 --> 00:00:15.566
He needs lots of things.

3
00:00:15.567 --> 00:00:21.595
He needs a crib and a swing.

4
00:00:21.596 --> 00:00:28.091
He needs bottles and bibs.

5
00:00:28.092 --> 00:00:35.392
He needs diapers and toys and blankets.

6
00:00:35.393 --> 00:00:47.246
Sometimes my baby brother is not fun!

7
00:00:47.247 --> 00:00:52.510
He sleeps a lot.

8
00:00:52.511 --> 00:01:08.182
He eats a lot.

9
00:01:08.183 --> 00:01:11.739
He cries a lot, and he is loud!

10
00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:17.985
Waa! Waa! Waa!

11
00:01:17.986 --> 00:01:26.039
But sometimes my baby brother is lots of fun!

12
00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:32.089
I hold him and rock him.

13
00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:44.793
I read books to him.

14
00:01:44.794 --> 00:01:48.608
I help him play with toys.

15
00:01:48.609 --> 00:01:52.716
And then, best of all . . .

16
00:01:52.717 --> 00:02:01.746
He smiles at me.

17
00:02:01.747 --> 00:02:09.873
I am his big sister!

